    <h1>Icon Maker</h1>
    <p class="landing-hero__lead">Front icon, back icon, background — stack three layers to make your own app icon, logo or profile picture. Add colors, gradients and shadows, let Style ideas suggest variations, then export PNGs in the sizes you need. No design skills required.</p>
