<section class="landing-section landing-section--alt">
  <div class="landing-section__inner">
    <h2>Privacy — plainly stated</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>No sign-up, no login.</strong> Open the app and start making.</li>
      <li><strong>Your designs and chosen photos stay on your device.</strong> Nothing is uploaded to a server.</li>
      <li>The network is used only to show ads and to fetch the sample photo list.</li>
      <li><strong>Ads</strong>: the app is free and uses Google AdMob. The AdMob SDK sends the advertising ID and impression/click data to Google.</li>
      <li>Icons come from open-source icon fonts (Material Icons — Apache License 2.0, Font Awesome Free — SIL OFL 1.1, MDI / Material Symbols). Full license details are in the in-app license screen.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

